                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.6363 St2/239: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Bolivia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-03-21T11:00:00-05:00">March 21, 1938—11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. Your 8, March 20, noon. You should not take the step suggested by the
                    Company.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
